WEBVTT

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.410
You're injured, right?

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:08.250
You shouldn't be here. You need to rest in the infirmary.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.320
Sorry.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.020
I'll help you anytime.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:50.670
Alicia... Sorry...

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.480
Chapter 21

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.480
Short-lived Bonds

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:17.970
Okay! We can move out anytime!

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:19.740
We're ready as well.

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:23.490
What's wrong, Commander?

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:26.630
Where's Alicia?

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:52.860
Commander!

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:10.250
What?! Alicia is gravely wounded?

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:13.960
The orderly said that she was shot!

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:16.720
She's unconscious right now.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:19.180
No way...

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.200
A-Are you all right?

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.180
Y-Yes...

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:27.710
But this seems kinda strange.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:32.150
If she was shot, does that mean there're Imperial snipers around?

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:36.450
But why would they shoot a lowly soldier like Alicia?

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:38.240
How does that matter right now?

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:41.020
No, it's just...

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:45.120
Wait! Commander, where are you going?

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:47.580
Of course, I'm going to take a look at Alicia.

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:05.110
Never mind.

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.680
Commander...

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:08.420
Everyone, let's move out!

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:09.810
But Alicia's...

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:15.570
Stopping the invasion and protecting Alicia... That's my...

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.410
That's our duty!

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:22.080
Come on! What're you guys doing? Let's get going!

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:26.090
We'll stop those Imperial scum with our own hands!

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:27.040
Yeah!

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:31.500
Alicia...

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:47.850
She's here.

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:52.010
Listen carefully. Only target the Valkyria.

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:55.690
Ignore the tanks behind her. Understood?

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:03.700
Fire!

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.730
Cease fire.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.000
Cease fire!

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:39.820
W-What?!

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:43.280
That entire bombardment was ineffective?!

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:45.580
Child's play!

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:51.790
Fire! Fire!

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:57.340
Disappear!

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:07.220
A-Amazing...

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:12.190
Hey, hey. Don't become so engrossed that you forget to drive.

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:15.150
If we don't maintain distance, we might get caught in it.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:19.520
Yes, sir! But she's truly overwhelming.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:22.080
She's a match for tens of thousands of soldiers!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:25.240
I don't think she'll need our support.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:28.450
I hope that's true.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:30.370
Reporting in!

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:35.960
The Imperial Valkyria has broken through the first line of defense! She's heading here at this very moment!

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:37.740
What?!

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:41.590
She broke through our defense lines so quickly...

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:44.840
Is this the power of the legendary Valkyrur?

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:46.700
Princess Cordelia!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:47.300
Yes.

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:52.560
I heard that you have the blood of the Valkyrur flowing in you.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:56.730
That Valkyrian spear and shield is the ultimate proof of that!

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:58.650
I-I'm...

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:02.700
Would you... Would you please fight using the power of the Valkyrur?!

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:04.860
General! Please calm down!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:06.990
I'm plenty calm!

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:10.870
Princess Cordelia, we're out of options!

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.170
But I...

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:13.710
It's not a problem!

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:16.140
2nd Lieutenant Landzaat.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.630
You're the one from earlier...

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:21.380
We have the power of a Valkyria on our side as well.

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:24.920
What? Who are you exactly?!

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:28.850
This is 2nd Lieutenant Faldio Landzaat, commander of Squad 1 from the militia.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:34.660
The situation is urgent. Please give the Valkyrian spear and shield to me!

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:39.750
You're just a commander from the militia. What are you trying to do?!

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:43.190
You said that we have the power of the Valkyrur too? Explain yourself!

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:44.880
Let go!

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:49.450
2nd Lieutenant Landzaat!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:56.010
Princess Cordelia, please bear with this for a bit.

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:58.770
What're you planning?!

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.710
Lieutenant, calm down!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:02.300
I'm perfectly calm!

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:08.930
I'm borrowing the spear and shield.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.470
Stop. Don't pursue.

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:14.000
Fool!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.490
Why not? Stop him!

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:21.270
Please... leave him to me. I'll bear the responsibility.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:30.330
What's this about? Please explain everything to me!

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.880
Alicia... Why?

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:52.580
Great.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:55.060
Umm.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.390
P-Princess Cordelia!

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:02.340
What is it?

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:04.170
Right.

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:08.980
It's about Sergeant Melchiott's injury. She's recovering abnormally fast...

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:12.060
What on earth is happening?

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:13.530
Got it. You're dismissed.

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:16.190
Sorry, but please get out.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:17.200
Yes, sir!

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:21.460
What in the world...

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:35.800
On the verge of death, she'll awaken as one of the warrior tribe - the Valkyrur.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:39.180
She'll recover quickly, and her true powers will awaken.

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:42.150
What exactly are you...

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:48.070
Alicia is...

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.070
...someone who inherited the blood of the Valkyrur!

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:53.530
What?

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:19.640
Damn!

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:28.570
I-Is she a monster?

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:41.080
Retreat! Retreat to the third line of defense for now!

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:44.460
The second line of defense has also been breached?!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.880
Sir! It's only a matter of time before she reaches the third line of defense!

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.780
Really, what're they doing?!

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:56.050
Even if she's a Valkyria, she's just a human!

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.890
What about Princess Cordelia?

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:00.110
Who cares?!

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:02.190
The militia said they'll take care of it.

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:04.280
We don't have to be concerned anymore!

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:08.930
But of all times for this to...

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.070
Looks like we have to call for a full-scale retreat.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.080
S-She's here!

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.540
Okay! Let's give it to her good!

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:30.800
Looks like Alicia's injury has affected him a little.

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:32.990
Well, of course he'd be.

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:34.970
I'm all right, Largo.

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:38.000
No matter what, we must stop them here.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.930
We'll protect Alicia.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.390
Yeah! That's right!

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:51.110
The retreating soldiers said that the Valkyria can deflect bullets and cannon fire with her spear and shield.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:55.480
Yeah. Attacking her directly might work.

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:59.830
We'll just have to try attacking from multiple directions at the same time.

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:07.250
Alicia! Alicia!

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:10.470
Please! Wake up, Alicia!

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:14.540
The Valkyria has reached the third line of defense.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:18.300
I repeat. The Valkyria has reached the third line of defense.

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:21.580
I repeat. The Valkyria has reached the third line of defense.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:21.580
We don't have time!

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:23.860
Alicia! Hey, Alicia!

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:25.560
Alicia! Alicia!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.960
Alicia, please!

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:29.900
Please wake up!

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:32.660
If not, I'll...

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:33.780
I'll...

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:40.240
Open your eyes, Alicia!

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:47.130
Alicia! Alicia!

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:56.150
Such power!

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.970
We're going to counterattack too!

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:09.150
Keep shooting! When she's concentrating on defense, she won't be able to counterattack so easily!

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:10.650
Start running and don't stay still!

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.860
Continue the attack from various directions!

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:29.330
Well, well. The power of the Valkyrur has its limits too.

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:34.050
The enemy is dividing up to surround Selvaria.

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:36.090
Let's cover her with firepower of our own too!

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:38.800
Mind your own business.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:42.050
Take this, you bitch!

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:46.810
Gotcha!

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:51.100
What?

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:56.730
Largo!

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.410
Is she trying to say that she doesn't need our help?

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:12.370
Largo!

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:12.370
Largo!

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.340
That was close. I almost died!

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:24.580
If this goes on, we won't be able to do anything, will we?

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:27.560
I don't want to admit it, but we can't stop her!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.480
What should we do, Commander?!

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:38.400
Retreat! Retreat to the last line of defense and meet up with the rest of the squads!

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:39.280
Got it!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.950
Everyone, don't stray from the Edelweiss!

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:45.980
Hey, Alicia! Alicia!

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:50.160
Alicia, can you hear me? {do you understand?} Alicia!

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:54.700
Alicia, it's me! Faldio!

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.540
I'm right by your side! Wake up!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:13:59.670
Alicia...

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:02.050
Please, I beg of you!

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:12.870
Reporting in! The third line of defense has fallen! Squad 7 is now retreating to the last line of defense!

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:13.940
Welkin?

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:17.470
Welkin?

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:23.780
I repeat! The third line of defense has fallen! Squad 7 is now retreating to the last line of defense!

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:25.820
Welkin...

00:14:35.070 --> 00:14:38.050
That's right. It's Welkin.

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:41.380
He's in big danger right now.

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:45.380
Save him...

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:48.100
Save Welkin, Alicia!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.020
Alicia.

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:01.480
I have to go...

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:15.370
Gallian army, heed me! Put down your weapons and surrender now!

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:17.570
Damn! Is this the end?

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:19.660
What are you saying? Are you kidding me?

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:21.340
I'm going to fight to the very end!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.680
Alicia?

00:15:36.070 --> 00:15:38.650
What's with her? What's going on?!

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:54.490
That girl's...

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.240
A Valkyria?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:10.680
What are you doing? Shoot her!

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:16.220
What?

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:23.610
Gallia has a Valkyria too? No one ever told us...

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:29.320
Attack! Attack her!

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.120
A-Amazing!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:40.080
Is that really Alicia?

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:51.760
There's no room for two Valkyria!

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:07.280
What?

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:22.790
You...

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:07.340
What was that just now?

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:11.210
Shoot! Shoot her!

00:18:14.310 --> 00:18:15.720
Alicia!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.220
The Batomys has fired!

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:18.930
What?

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:24.300
Ridiculous...

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:25.810
She's unbelievable!

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.040
Maximilian!

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:51.670
I never thought this would happen...

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:56.640
Retreat! All troops retreat!

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.970
Maximilian!

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:23.280
We're going back.

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:39.400
What the hell just happened?

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:43.110
Is that really Alicia?

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:45.140
I have no idea...

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:47.600
Alicia!

00:19:58.480 --> 00:19:59.990
Alicia!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:09.510
Alicia, you're...

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.200
I'm Homer Peron.

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:18.120
Why did someone like me join the militia, you ask?

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:21.370
Why? I don't know.

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:28.910
One thing is clear, though. There's happiness in the sadness of war.

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:33.110
Next time on Valkyria Chronicles,

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:36.320
Chapter 22: Confusion.

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:41.000
Chapter 22

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:41.000
Confusion

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:40.870
The weak understand what it means to be strong because of their very weakness.
